reply:
I'll build the landing page as one surface. A full-width `columns` root (one column) holds the hero, the three-feature grid, the testimonial, and the closing call-to-action.

<a2ui-json>
[
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "createSurface": {
      "surfaceId": "landing-page",
      "catalogId": "https://a2uicatalog.ai/catalog/d-t3.json"
    }
  },
  {
    "version": "v0.9",
    "updateComponents": {
      "surfaceId": "landing-page",
      "components": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "component": "columns",
          "cols": 1,
          "gap": "0",
          "align": "stretch",
          "items": [
            {
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "id": "hero",
                  "component": "gradient_hero",
                  "badge": "New for 2025",
                  "title": "Ship faster with Acme",
                  "subtitle": "Acme gives product teams one place to plan, build, and launch features without the busywork.",
                  "align": "center",
                  "accent": "#4f46e5",
                  "accent2": "#8b5cf6"
                },
                {
                  "id": "features",
                  "component": "feature_grid",
                  "heading": "Everything you need to launch",
                  "description": "Three core capabilities that keep your team moving.",
                  "columns": 3,
                  "features": [
                    {
                      "icon": "⚡",
                      "title": "Instant setup",
                      "description": "Connect your repositories and start shipping in minutes, not days.",
                      "color": "#4f46e5"
                    },
                    {
                      "icon": "🔗",
                      "title": "Seamless integrations",
                      "description": "Works with the tools you already use, including GitHub, Slack, and Jira.",
                      "color": "#8b5cf6"
                    },
                    {
                      "icon": "📊",
                      "title": "Clear insights",
                      "description": "Track progress and release health with dashboards that update in real time.",
                      "color": "#0ea5e9"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "testimonial",
                  "component": "testimonial_card",
                  "text": "Acme cut our release cycle in half. The team finally spends time building instead of coordinating.",
                  "author_name": "Priya Raman",
                  "author_title": "VP of Engineering, Northwind",
                  "rating": 5
                },
                {
                  "id": "cta",
                  "component": "cta_section",
                  "heading": "Ready to ship your next release?",
                  "body": "Start your free 14-day trial today. No credit card required.",
                  "primary_cta": {
                    "label": "Start free trial",
                    "url": "https://example.com/signup"
                  },
                  "secondary_cta": {
                    "label": "Talk to sales",
                    "url": "https://example.com/contact"
                  },
                  "background": "#4f46e5"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
]
</a2ui-json>

The page uses the `gradient_hero` for the headline and subhead, `feature_grid` with three columns for the features, `testimonial_card` for the quote, and `cta_section` for the closing button. The `cta_section` has a primary button, which covers the call-to-action requirement.
